<div class="mandarin-hanzi">米饭</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">mǐfàn</div>

''Meaning:'' cooked rice  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
我去超市买鸡蛋和米饭。 — Wǒ qù chāoshì mǎi jīdàn hé mǐfàn. — I’m going to the supermarket to buy eggs and rice.

!! Usage note
Refers to cooked rice; distinguish from 生米 “uncooked rice.”
